  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Persistent Inventory Search 是一款客戶端模組，旨在大幅簡化創造模式下的物品欄管理。預設情況下，使用搜尋功能時，一旦切換至不同標籤頁或關閉物品欄，搜尋條件就會被清除。此模組會記錄您的搜尋內容，並在再次開啟搜尋標籤頁時立即恢復顯示。讓您能持續操作喜愛的方塊，無需反覆輸入它們的名稱。<br><br>其餘物品欄與標籤頁的操作行為則維持原樣。<br></span><strong><br><br></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg&w=718\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的客戶端套件\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"運行環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>模組功能說明：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/persistent-inventory-search/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span>預設行為<span><strong>未安裝</strong></span>此模組：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/persistent-inventory-search/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模組，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與詳細資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 交流。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
